        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Guang o, lumloumei guai",
            "Rih ngamna neihla na",
            "He guang o, Bethlehem thang tat dikho!",
            "Guang zau lo, baanch’ra nun guai",
            "Guangh puanlou the!",
            "",
            "Guang o, aniu kalum kho,",
            "Guang o, aniu kalum kho,",
            "Poubaumei Khrista ta,",
            "Kalum dikho!",
            "",
            "2. He baanch’ra guai suan o,",
            "Neihla thauna suan o.",
            "He suan o, nangniu tingkauhmei kaguaina!",
            "Kauh liangmei khou Raguang himdaimei sudiu!",
            "",
            "3. Neihlamei laukhuan khou,",
            "Kaipou Nang ta ‘riu e,",
            "He Jisu, himdaimei tei Nang khang sudiu;",
            "Kapu latkaeng rui maansei guanhna puanhmei!"
          ]
        }
      }
